// Title: Suspicious Windows Defender Registry Key Tampering Via Reg.EXE
// ID: 452bce90-6fb0-43cc-97a5-affc283139b3
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems), Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel, Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2022-03-22
// Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
// Description: Detects the usage of "reg.exe" to tamper with different Windows Defender registry keys in order to disable some important features related to protection and detection
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where ((((process.executable endswith "\\reg.exe") or (process.pe.original_file_name == "reg.exe")) and ((process.command_line like "*_SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\*" or process.command_line like "*_SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender Security Center*" or process.command_line like "*_SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows Defender\\*"))) and (((process.command_line like "*_ add *" and process.command_line like "*_d 0*") and (process.command_line like "*_DisallowExploitProtectionOverride*" or process.command_line like "*_EnableControlledFolderAccess*" or process.command_line like "*_MpEnablePus*" or process.command_line like "*_PUAProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_SpynetReporting*" or process.command_line like "*_SubmitSamplesConsent*" or process.command_line like "*_TamperProtection*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_ add *" and process.command_line like "*_d 1*") and (process.command_line like "*_DisableAccess*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableAntiSpyware*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableAntiSpywareRealtimeProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableAntiVirus*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableAntiVirusSignatures*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableArchiveScanning*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableBehaviorMonitoring*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableBlockAtFirstSeen*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableCloudProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableConfig*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableEnhancedNotifications*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableIntrusionPreventionSystem*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableIOAVProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableNetworkProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableOnAccessProtection*" or process.command_line like "*_DisablePrivacyMode*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableRealtimeMonitoring*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableRoutinelyTakingAction*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableScanOnRealtimeEnable*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableScriptScanning*" or process.command_line like "*_DisableSecurityCenter*" or process.command_line like "*_Notification_Suppress*" or process.command_line like "*_SignatureDisableUpdateOnStartupWithoutEngine*"))))
